%% Repody — Architecture as a SEQUENCE diagram
%% Principal components interacting over time (one audit run)
%% Open in VS Code Mermaid preview, GitHub, or https://mermaid.live
%% Docs: CONTEXT.md · docs/LOCAL.md

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor User as User
  participant FE as Frontend<br/>(Next.js)
  participant KC as Keycloak<br/>(OIDC)
  participant API as API<br/>(FastAPI)
  participant Casbin as Casbin<br/>(roles)
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant MinIO as MinIO<br/>(files)
  participant Redis as Redis<br/>(Taskiq + SSE)
  participant TQ as Taskiq worker<br/>(background jobs)
  participant VLM as Inference<br/>(NuExtract / VLM)

  %% ── Auth ───────────────────────────────────────────────
  rect rgba(245, 230, 240, 0.45)
    Note over User,Casbin: 1 — Login and authorization
    User->>FE: Open UI
    FE->>KC: OIDC login (Auth.js)
    KC-->>FE: Tokens + roles
    User->>FE: Call API action
    FE->>API: /api/v1 + Bearer JWT
    API->>KC: Validate JWT (JWKS)
    KC-->>API: OK
    API->>Casbin: Check permission<br/>viewer / operator / admin
    Casbin-->>API: Allow / deny
  end

  %% ── Upload ─────────────────────────────────────────────
  rect rgba(245, 240, 230, 0.45)
    Note over User,MinIO: 2 — Upload document (presigned)
    User->>FE: Choose file
    FE->>API: Presign upload
    API->>PG: Record upload intent
    API->>MinIO: Create presigned PUT URL
    API-->>FE: URL + storage key
    FE->>MinIO: PUT file bytes
    MinIO-->>FE: 200 OK
    FE->>API: Confirm upload
    API->>MinIO: HeadObject / MIME check
    API->>PG: Confirm upload
    API-->>FE: File ready
  end

  %% ── Enqueue ────────────────────────────────────────────
  rect rgba(232, 244, 252, 0.45)
    Note over FE,Redis: 3 — Start audit run (API → Taskiq via Redis)
    FE->>API: Start run (JWT or API key)
    API->>Casbin: Can execute run?
    Casbin-->>API: Allow
    API->>PG: Insert Run (queued) + outbox
    API-->>FE: 202 + runId
    API->>Redis: Dispatch Taskiq job<br/>queue extract | fast
  end

  %% ── Background job ─────────────────────────────────────
  rect rgba(238, 246, 232, 0.45)
    Note over Redis,VLM: 4 — Background job (Taskiq)
    Redis->>TQ: Deliver job
    TQ->>PG: Claim run (queued → running)
    TQ->>Redis: Publish progress
    TQ->>MinIO: GET document
    MinIO-->>TQ: PDF / image bytes
    TQ->>VLM: chat.completions<br/>(repody:vlm / NuExtract)
    VLM-->>TQ: Structured JSON fields
    TQ->>PG: Save extracted fields
    TQ->>TQ: Apply logic rules<br/>(+ optional LLM rules)
    TQ->>PG: Save rule results · Run done/failed
    TQ->>Redis: Publish terminal event
  end

  %% ── Live UI ────────────────────────────────────────────
  rect rgba(255, 244, 224, 0.45)
    Note over User,Redis: 5 — Live updates (SSE) + report
    FE->>API: Subscribe SSE /runs/{id}/events
    API->>Redis: Subscribe progress channel
    loop While running
      Redis-->>API: Progress event
      API-->>FE: SSE stream
      FE-->>User: Show steps live
    end
    Redis-->>API: done / failed
    API-->>FE: Terminal event
    FE->>API: GET full report
    API->>PG: Load run + fields + rules
    PG-->>API: Report data
    API-->>FE: Full audit report
    FE-->>User: Display report
  end
